Generic single-database configuration with an async dbapi.


Open two separate PowerShell terminals from the project root.

Terminal 1 — Backend
.\.venv\Scripts\python -m uvicorn talentscout.api.main:app --reload --app-dir backend/src


Requires your configured database and backend .env.


Terminal 2 — Frontend
cd frontend
npm run build
npm run dev


Open the local URL Vite prints, normally http://localhost:5173